.TH ferry-web 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-web \- Share files with a web browser on the local network and receive files from it, through a one\-time link and QR code (the other device needs no app)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry web\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-receive\fR] [\fB\-\-minutes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILES\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Share files with a web browser on the local network and receive files from it, through a one\-time link and QR code (the other device needs no app)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-receive\fR
Do not let the browser send files here
.TP
\fB\-\-minutes\fR \fI<MINUTES>\fR [default: 30]
Minutes until the link stops working
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILES\fR]
Files the browser can download (none: only receive)
